OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced over 'premeditated'
OL,4,Ahammer attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who repeatedly hit his victim on
OL,7,Fthe head with a hammer in a
OL,8,F"premeditated violent attack" has been
OL,9,Fsentenced to a minimum of six years in
OL,10,Fprison.
OL,12,FNathan Scholey, 32, assaulted a man in
OL,13,Fhis 40s following an argument on
OL,14,FMelksham High Street, in Wiltshire, on
OL,15,F17 October.
OL,17,FScholey, of no fixed abode, previously
OL,18,Fdenied the attack but was found guilty
OL,19,Fof inflicting grievous bodily harm with
OL,20,Fintent by a jury at Winchester Crown
OL,21,FCourt.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
