OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced over 'premeditated'
OL,4,Ahammer attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Advocate Atwill said: "This was a
OL,7,Fviolent and dangerous attack which has
OL,8,Fleft the victim anxious, particularly
OL,9,Fin social or crowded settings."
